# Carelune — Supabase configuration.
# Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in the values from your Supabase project
# (Project Settings → API). The key below is the client-safe *publishable* key —
# never put the service_role / secret key in the frontend.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=sb_publishable_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# --- Product origins (see src/config/urls.ts) ---------------------------------
# PUBLIC, non-secret. Set per Netlify site (build environment).
#
# APPLICATION build (app.carelune.in): leave VITE_APP_BASE_URL UNSET so app-internal
#   links (registration, password recovery) fall back to the current origin — which
#   is correct in dev (localhost), preview, and production (app.carelune.in).
# MARKETING build (carelune.in): VITE_APP_BASE_URL MUST be set so the "Sign in" link
#   points at the application origin. Provided by the committed `.env.marketing`
#   for `--mode marketing`; override via Netlify env if the app domain changes.
#
# VITE_APP_BASE_URL=https://app.carelune.in
# VITE_MARKETING_BASE_URL=https://carelune.in
